FoamFile{version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object topoSetDict;}
// The MRF zone is the ROTOR PASSAGE, not the whole domain.
//
// With the zone covering everything, the frame rotation applies at the
// inlet patch too, giving the incoming flow a -omega*r tangential
// component of about 400 m/s before the totalPressure condition is
// evaluated. The result was a rotor that did no work at all: outlet static
// temperature 257 K against a 288 K inlet, which is T0 = 288 throughout,
// and a mass flow eleven times below design.
//
// The blade spans x = 0 to 0.0439 m (hub LE to hub TE). The zone is taken
// a little either side of it and stops well short of both patches.
actions
(
    { name rotor; type cellSet; action new; source boxToCell;
      box (-0.012 -1 -1) (0.056 1 1); }
    { name rotor; type cellZoneSet; action new; source setToCellZone; set rotor; }
);
